WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.105
Stepmother laughed at Cinderella.

2
00:00:08.106 --> 00:00:10.588
"You?" she said.

3
00:00:10.589 --> 00:00:13.865
"It can't be your shoe.

4
00:00:13.866 --> 00:00:17.074
You did not go to the balls."

5
00:00:17.075 --> 00:00:22.679
The messenger looked at Cinderella.

6
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.159
She was dressed in rags but . . .

7
00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.096
The messenger had orders from the prince.

8
00:00:28.097 --> 00:00:35.548
Every lady must try on the shoe.

9
00:00:35.549 --> 00:00:40.965
Cinderella took a deep breath.

10
00:00:40.966 --> 00:00:46.963
Slowly she slid her foot into the glass shoe.

11
00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:52.546
Her stepsisters gasped. "It fits?"

12
00:00:52.547 --> 00:00:55.918
The messenger blinked.

13
00:00:55.919 --> 00:01:01.498
"It's you!" he cried. "You are the princess!"

14
00:01:01.499 --> 00:01:06.351
Stepmother stomped over to Cinderella.

15
00:01:06.352 --> 00:01:09.432
"Impossible!" she snapped.

16
00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:12.502
"You never left this house!"

17
00:01:12.503 --> 00:01:15.272
Cinderella reached into her pocket.

18
00:01:15.273 --> 00:01:22.438
She took out the other shoe and put it on.

19
00:01:22.439 --> 00:01:26.293
Suddenly her fairy godmother appeared.

20
00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:30.782
Godmother waved her wand. [i@Poof!@i]

21
00:01:30.783 --> 00:01:41.729
Cinderella was the beautiful princess again.

22
00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:44.851
Gert and Trudy each gave a curtsy.

23
00:01:44.852 --> 00:01:48.917
"We are very sorry," they said.

24
00:01:48.918 --> 00:01:53.974
Stepmother folded her arms. "Hmph!"

25
00:01:53.975 --> 00:01:56.373
The messenger was smiling.

26
00:01:56.374 --> 00:01:58.795
"You must come with me.

27
00:01:58.796 --> 00:02:10.952
The prince will be so happy!"

28
00:02:10.953 --> 00:02:24.207
Soon Cinderella was back at the palace.

29
00:02:24.208 --> 00:02:30.131
Three days later she married the handsome prince.

30
00:02:30.132 --> 00:02:43.210
Cinderella was really a princess now.

31
00:02:43.211 --> 00:02:48.312
But she was still very kind.

32
00:02:48.313 --> 00:02:53.253
So Cinderella invited her stepsisters to live with her.

33
00:02:53.254 --> 00:02:59.700
She even invited Stepmother.

34
00:02:59.701 --> 00:03:14.429
And they all lived happily ever after.

